      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "About two weeks ago, I noticed a sharp FPS drop in VR-mode for VRChat. Desktop mode is OK. I do not know the reason. Maybe the game bugs , maybe SteamVR update, maybe video drivers update. Another VR-games are OK. So VR-mode in VRChat is not usable for me.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
