      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's been more than a couple of updates for us. We ran a few tests with the same avatars, same amounts of people, same world, etc. One update took us from 5 people on the same avatar with the same animation  producing no noticeable lag or any issues, to one person lagging everyone to death. Nothing changed but the update.\n\nIt's been a good two to three months or so of ever decreasing performance. I mean we used to get 60 people in the Pug before having the issues we get with 20 people in the Box now.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
