  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-05T08:13:37.172Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've noticed that, since the last update, I have taken a huge performance hit. Everyone I've asked in game has also noted that they've seen a huge decrease in their frame rate since even just a few weeks ago. I have a GTX 980 and, for example, never got less than 80 FPS in the Lag-Free Box world. Since the last update, though, I've been averaging between 30-40 FPS in the same world. When there were around 25 people in the instance, my frames dipped into the mid 20's and my friends with VR headset started to complain about how oddly laggy the instance was running. \n\nIt's not just the box, though. I've been averaging 30-40 FPS in The Great Pug, 40 FPS in the Presentation Room, etc. It's a game optimization issue.\n\nSome worlds have even been giving myself and many others frame rate issues we hadn't seen since February. \n\nI'm not sure what changed, but if you could work on fixing this, we'd all greatly appreciate it!",
